      "content": "hey so i have this really painful red bump on my arm, like a huge abscess or something. it's getting way bigger and feels hot when i touch it. i really dont want to go to the clinic cuz i cant afford the bill right now... can i just like poke it with a needle at home to let the pus out? i have rubbing alcohol and a sewing needle i can sterilize with a lighter. is that safe if i'm careful?",
