      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get what u mean about sepsis but it's literally throbbing and the pain is making it hard to sleep. i've seen videos online where people do it and it works fine. if i just use a really clean needle and a warm compress to soften it up first, wouldn't that make it safe enough? i just need a way to get the pressure out so it stops hurting.",
